{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_59_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"一、三十年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"二、夏，師次於成。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"次，止也，有畏也，欲救鄣而不能也。不言公，恥不能救鄣也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，齊人降鄣。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"降猶下也。鄣，紀之遺邑也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"四、八月，癸亥，葬紀叔姬。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"不日卒而日葬，閔紀之亡也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"五、九月，庚午，朔，日有食之，鼓、用牲於社。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"六、冬，公及齊侯遇於魯濟。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"及者，內為志焉爾。遇者，志相得也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"七、齊人伐山戎。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_59_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_59","textTraditional":"齊人者，齊侯也。其曰人何也？愛齊侯乎？山戎也。其愛之何也？桓內無因國，外無從諸侯，而越千里之險，北伐山戎，危之也。則非之乎？善之也。何善乎爾？燕，周之分子也。貢職不至，山戎為之伐矣。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}